Google Maps : Uses ML to predict traffic and suggest fastest routes.
YouTube Recommendations : ML suggests videos based on watch history.
Netflix : Recommends movies using user similarity (collaborative filtering).
Google Assistant / Siri : Uses speech recognition and NLP to understand voice.
Gmail Spam Filter : ML classifies emails as spam or important.
Instagram Feed : AI ranks posts based on likes and interactions.
Amazon Product Suggestions : Recommends items using purchase history.
Face Unlock in Phone : Uses computer vision to recognize face.
Autocorrect Keyboard : Predicts next word using language models.
Online Shopping Chatbots : NLP-based bots answer customer questions.
